#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:31
msgid ""
"\n"
"    The Seasonal Water Yield (SWY) model estimates the amount of water produced\n"
"    by a watershed, arriving in streams over the course of a year. The primary\n"
"    outputs of the model are quickflow, local recharge, and baseflow. Quickflow\n"
"    represents the amount of precipitation that runs off of the land directly,\n"
"    during and soon after a rain event, and local recharge represents the amount\n"
"    of rainfall that infiltrates into soil, minus what is evaporated or used by\n"
"    vegetation. Baseflow is the amount of precipitation that enters streams more\n"
"    gradually through sub-surface flow, including during the dry season. The model\n"
"    is based on inputs of topography (DEM), soils, land cover and management,\n"
"    rainfall, and vegetation water demand.\n"
"    "
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    El modelo de Rendimiento hídrico estacional (SWY) estima la cantidad de agua producida\n"
"    por una cuenca que llega a los cursos de agua a lo largo del año. Sus principales resultados\n"
"    son el flujo rápido, la recarga local y el flujo base. El flujo rápido representa la cantidad"
"\n"
"    de precipitación que escurre directamente por la superficie durante un episodio de lluvia y\n"
"    poco después. La recarga local representa la cantidad de lluvia que se infiltra en el suelo,\n"
"    descontando la evaporación y el agua utilizada por la vegetación. El flujo base es la "
"cantidad\n"
"    de precipitación que llega a los cursos de agua de forma más gradual mediante el flujo\n"
"    subsuperficial, incluso durante la estación seca. El modelo utiliza datos de topografía "
"(DEM),\n"
"    suelos, cobertura y manejo del suelo, precipitación y demanda de agua de la vegetación.\n"
"    "

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:46
msgid "Seasonal Water Yield"
msgstr "Rendimiento hídrico estacional"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:72
msgid "ET0 table"
msgstr "Tabla ET0"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:74
msgid ""
"Table mapping month indexes (1-12) to reference evapotranspiration raster paths. The paths may be"
" either absolute or relative to the location of the ET0 table itself. Required if User-Defined "
"Local Recharge is not selected."
msgstr ""
"Tabla que relaciona los índices mensuales (1-12) con las rutas de los rásteres de "
"evapotranspiración de referencia. Las rutas pueden ser absolutas o relativas a la ubicación de la"
" propia tabla ET0. Es obligatoria si no se selecciona la opción de recarga local definida por el "
"usuario."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:84
#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:112
msgid "The month index (1-12)."
msgstr "Índice del mes (1-12)."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:90
msgid "Path to a reference evapotranspiration raster for the month."
msgstr "Ruta al ráster de evapotranspiración de referencia para el mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:100
msgid "precipitation table"
msgstr "tabla de precipitación"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:102
msgid ""
"Table mapping month indexes (1-12) to monthly precipitation raster paths. The paths may be either"
" absolute or relative to the location of the precipitation table itself. Required if User-Defined"
" Local Recharge is not selected."
msgstr ""
"Tabla que relaciona los índices mensuales (1-12) con las rutas de los rásteres mensuales de "
"precipitación. Las rutas pueden ser absolutas o relativas a la ubicación de la propia tabla de "
"precipitación. Es obligatoria si no se selecciona la opción de recarga local definida por el "
"usuario."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:117
msgid "Path to a precipitation raster for the month."
msgstr "Ruta al ráster de precipitación del mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:129
msgid ""
"Map of land use/land cover codes. Each land use/land cover type must be assigned a unique integer"
" code. All values in this raster MUST have corresponding entries in the Biophysical Table."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de códigos de uso y cobertura del suelo (LULC). Cada tipo debe tener un código entero único."
" TODOS los valores de este ráster DEBEN tener entradas correspondientes en la tabla biofísica."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:150
msgid ""
"A table mapping each LULC code to biophysical properties of the corresponding LULC class. All "
"values in the LULC raster must have corresponding entries in this table."
msgstr ""
"Una tabla que asigna cada código LULC a las propiedades biofísicas de la clase LULC "
"correspondiente. Todos los valores del ráster LULC deben tener los inputs correspondientes en "
"esta tabla."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:159
msgid ""
"Curve number values for each combination of soil group and LULC class. Replace [SOIL_GROUP] with "
"each soil group code A, B, C, D so that there is one column for each soil group. Curve number "
"values must be greater than 0 and less than or equal to 100."
msgstr ""
"Valores del número de curva para cada combinación de grupo de suelo y clase LULC. Sustituya "
"[SOIL_GROUP] por cada código de grupo de suelo (A, B, C o D), de modo que haya una columna para "
"cada grupo. Los valores del número de curva deben ser mayores que 0 y menores o iguales a 100."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:170
msgid ""
"Crop/vegetation coefficient (Kc) values for this LULC class in each month. Replace [MONTH] with "
"the numbers 1 to 12 so that there is one column for each month."
msgstr ""
"Valores del coeficiente de cultivo/vegetación (Kc) para esta clase LULC en cada mes. Sustituya "
"[MES] por los números del 1 al 12 para que haya una columna para cada mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:181
msgid "rain events table"
msgstr "tabla de eventos de lluvia"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:183
msgid ""
"A table containing the number of rain events for each month. Required if neither User-Defined "
"Local Recharge nor User-Defined Climate Zones is selected."
msgstr ""
"Una tabla que contiene el número de eventos de lluvia para cada mes. Se requiere si no se "
"selecciona ni \"capa de recarga definida por el usuario (avanzado)\" ni \"zonas climáticas "
"(avanzado)\"."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:195
#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:492
msgid "Values are the numbers 1-12 corresponding to each month, January (1) through December (12)."
msgstr ""
"Los valores son los números del 1 al 12 correspondientes a cada mes, de enero (1) a diciembre "
"(12)."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:202
msgid "The number of rain events in that month."
msgstr "El número de eventos de lluvia en ese mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:210
msgid "alpha_m parameter"
msgstr "parámetro alpha_m"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:212
msgid ""
"The proportion of upslope annual available local recharge that is available in each month. "
"Required if Use Monthly Alpha Table is not selected."
msgstr ""
"La proporción de la recarga local anual disponible pendiente arriba que está disponible en cada "
"mes. Requerido si no se selecciona la opción de usar la tabla mensual Alpha."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:222
msgid "beta_i parameter"
msgstr "parámetro beta_i"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:224
msgid "The proportion of the upgradient subsidy that is available for downgradient evapotranspiration."
msgstr "La proporción del subsidio ascendente que está disponible para la evapotranspiración descendente."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:231
msgid "gamma parameter"
msgstr "parámetro gamma"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:233
msgid "The proportion of pixel local recharge that is available to downgradient pixels."
msgstr "La proporción de la recarga local del píxel que está disponible para los píxeles pendiente abajo."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:240
msgid "user-defined recharge layer (advanced)"
msgstr "capa de recarga definida por el usuario (avanzado)"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:242
msgid ""
"Use user-defined local recharge data instead of calculating local recharge from the other "
"provided data."
msgstr ""
"Utilizar los datos de recarga local definidos por el usuario en lugar de calcular la recarga "
"local a partir de los otros datos proporcionados."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:248
msgid "local recharge"
msgstr "recarga local"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:250
msgid "Map of local recharge data. Required if User-Defined Local Recharge is selected."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de datos de recarga local. Se necesita si se selecciona la opción de recarga local definida "
"por el usuario."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:261
msgid "climate zones (advanced)"
msgstr "zonas climáticas (avanzado)"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:263
msgid "Use user-defined climate zone data in lieu of a global rain events table."
msgstr ""
"Utilizar datos de zonas climáticas definidas por el usuario en lugar de una tabla global de "
"eventos de lluvia."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:269
msgid "climate zone table"
msgstr "tabla de zonas climáticas"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:271
msgid ""
"Table of monthly precipitation events for each climate zone. Required if User-Defined Climate "
"Zones is selected."
msgstr ""
"Tabla de eventos de precipitación mensual para cada zona climática. Se requiere si se selecciona "
"\"zonas climáticas (avanzado)\"."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:280
msgid "Climate zone ID numbers, corresponding to the values in the Climate Zones map."
msgstr ""
"Números de identificación de la zona climática, correspondientes a los valores del mapa de las "
"zonas climáticas."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:287
msgid ""
"The number of rain events that occur in each month in this climate zone. Replace [MONTH] with the"
" month abbreviations: jan, feb, mar, apr, may, jun, jul, aug, sep, oct, nov, dec, so that there "
"is a column for each month."
msgstr ""
"El número de eventos de lluvia que se producen en cada mes en esta zona climática. Sustituya "
"[MES] por las abreviaturas de los meses: ene, feb, mar, abr, may, jun, jul, ago, sep, oct, nov y "
"dic, de modo que haya una columna para cada mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:299
msgid "climate zone map"
msgstr "mapa de zonas climáticas"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:301
msgid ""
"Map of climate zones. All values in this raster must have corresponding entries in the Climate "
"Zone Table."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de zonas climáticas. Todos los valores de este raster deben tener los inputs "
"correspondientes en la Tabla de Zonas Climáticas."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:312
msgid "use monthly alpha table (advanced)"
msgstr "utilizar la tabla alfa mensual (avanzado)"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:314
msgid "Use montly alpha values instead of a single value for the whole year."
msgstr "Utilizar valores alfa mensuales en lugar de un único valor para todo el año."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:319
msgid "monthly alpha table"
msgstr "tabla alfa mensual"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:321
msgid "Table of alpha values for each month. Required if Use Monthly Alpha Table is selected."
msgstr ""
"Tabla de valores alfa para cada mes. Es necesaria si se selecciona \"utilizar la tabla alfa "
"mensual (avanzado)\"."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:330
msgid "Values are the numbers 1-12 corresponding to each month."
msgstr "Los valores son los números 1-12 correspondientes a cada mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:336
msgid "The alpha value for that month."
msgstr "El valor alfa de ese mes."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:349
msgid ""
"Map of baseflow values, the contribution of a pixel to slow release flow (which is not "
"evapotranspired before it reaches the stream)."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de valores del flujo de base, la contribución de un píxel al flujo de liberación lenta (que "
"no se evapotranspira antes de llegar a la corriente)."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:359
msgid ""
"Map of B_sum values, the flow through a pixel, contributed by all upslope pixels, that is not "
"evapotranspirated before it reaches the stream."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de valores B_sum, el flujo que atraviesa un píxel, aportado por todos los píxeles de "
"pendiente ascendente, que no es evapotranspirado antes de llegar a la corriente."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:369
msgid "Map of curve number values."
msgstr "Mapa de líneas centrales de carreteras."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:378
msgid ""
"Map of local recharge. If a user-defined local recharge input is provided, this is a copy of that"
" layer, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs. Otherwise, this is the local "
"recharge as calculated by the model. Local recharge can be negative if a pixel does not receive "
"enough of its own water to satisfy its vegetation requirements."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de recarga local. Si se proporciona una capa de recarga local definida por el usuario, esta "
"es una copia alineada y recortada para coincidir con las demás entradas espaciales. De lo "
"contrario, representa la recarga local calculada por el modelo. La recarga local puede ser "
"negativa si un píxel no recibe suficiente agua propia para satisfacer las necesidades de su "
"vegetación."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:391
msgid "Map of available local recharge"
msgstr "Mapa de recarga local disponible"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:399
msgid ""
"Map of total available water, contributed by all upslope pixels, that is available for "
"evapotranspiration by this pixel."
msgstr ""
"Mapa del total de agua disponible, aportada por todos los píxeles de pendiente ascendente, que "
"está disponible para evapotranspiración por este píxel."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:410
msgid ""
"Map of cumulative upstream recharge: the flow through a pixel, contributed by all upslope pixels,"
" that is available for evapotranspiration to downslope pixels."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de recarga acumulada aguas arriba: el flujo a través de un píxel, aportado por todos los "
"píxeles de pendiente ascendente, que está disponible para la evapotranspiración hacia los píxeles"
" de pendiente descendente."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:420
msgid "Map of quickflow"
msgstr "Mapa de flujo rápido"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:429
msgid "The total precipitation across all months on this pixel."
msgstr "La precipitación total a lo largo de todos los meses en este píxel."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:438
msgid "Map of the values of recharge (contribution, positive or negative), to the total recharge."
msgstr "Mapa de los valores de recarga (contribución, positiva o negativa), a la recarga total."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:447
msgid "Table of biophysical values for each watershed"
msgstr "Tabla de propiedades biofísicas para cada clase de LULC"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:452
msgid "Mean local recharge value within the watershed"
msgstr "Valor medio de recarga local en la cuenca"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:458
msgid "Total recharge contribution (positive or negative) within the watershed."
msgstr "Contribución total de recarga (positiva o negativa) dentro de la cuenca."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:466
msgid "A unique ID for the watershed."
msgstr "Identificador único de la cuenca."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:477
msgid ""
"Table of average monthly baseflow, quickflow, and precipitation values for each watershed (or "
"feature) within the AOI."
msgstr ""
"Tabla de los valores medios mensuales de flujo base, flujo rápido y precipitación para cada "
"cuenca (o entidad) dentro del área de estudio (AOI)."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:484
msgid ""
"A unique ID for the watershed. This will correspond to the 'geom_id' column in the Aggregate "
"Results shapefile."
msgstr ""
"Identificador único de la cuenca. Corresponde a la columna 'geom_id' del archivo shapefile de "
"resultados agregados."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:500
msgid "The average quickflow value for the month in the watershed, expressed in cubic meters."
msgstr "Valor medio del flujo rápido del mes en la cuenca, expresado en metros cúbicos."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:508
msgid ""
"The average baseflow value for the month in the watershed, expressed in cubic meters. Since "
"baseflow is calculated on an annual scale, the values for each watershed have been distributed "
"evenly across the year (annual average divided by 12)."
msgstr ""
"Valor medio del flujo base del mes en la cuenca, expresado en metros cúbicos. Como el flujo base "
"se calcula a escala anual, sus valores se distribuyen uniformemente a lo largo del año (promedio "
"anual dividido para 12)."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:519
msgid ""
"The average precipitation value for the month in the watershed, expressed in cubic meters. Values"
" are based on the aligned input monthly precipitation rasters."
msgstr ""
"Valor medio de la precipitación del mes en la cuenca, expresado en metros cúbicos. Los valores se"
" basan en los rásteres mensuales de precipitación de entrada, ya alineados."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:532
msgid "Map of actual evapotranspiration"
msgstr "Mapa de valores de evapotranspiración"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:541
msgid "Map of flow direction, in either D8 or MFD format according to the option selected."
msgstr "Mapa de dirección de flujo en formato D8 o MFD, según la opción seleccionada."

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:551
msgid "Maps of monthly quickflow (1 = January… 12 = December)"
msgstr "Mapas de flujo rápido mensual (1 = enero … 12 = diciembre)"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:560
msgid "Map of the S_i factor derived from CN"
msgstr "Mapa del factor S_i derivado de CN"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:569
msgid "Copy of LULC input, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs"
msgstr "Copia de la entrada LULC, alineada y recortada para que coincida con las otras entradas espaciales"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:579
msgid "Copy of DEM input, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs"
msgstr "Copia de la entrada MDE, alineada y recortada para que coincida con las otras entradas espaciales"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:588
msgid "Pit filled DEM"
msgstr "MDE con relleno de fosas"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:596
msgid "Copy of soil groups input, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs"
msgstr ""
"Copia de la entrada de grupos de suelos, alineada y recortada para que coincida con las otras "
"entradas espaciales"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:610
msgid "Monthly precipitation rasters, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs"
msgstr ""
"Rásteres mensuales de precipitaciones, alineados y recortados para ajustarse a las demás entradas"
" espaciales"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:620
msgid "Map of monthly rain events"
msgstr "Mapa de eventos de lluvia mensuales"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:629
msgid "Monthly ET0 rasters, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs"
msgstr "Rásteres mensuales ET0, alineados y recortados para ajustarse a las demás entradas espaciales"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:639
msgid "Map of monthly KC values"
msgstr "Mapa de valores mensuales de KC"

#: src/natcap/invest/seasonal_water_yield/seasonal_water_yield.py:648
msgid "Copy of user-defined climate zones raster, aligned and clipped to match the other spatial inputs"
msgstr ""
"Copia del ráster de las zonas climáticas definidas por el usuario, alineadas y recortadas para "
"que coincidan con las demás entradas espaciales"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:25
msgid "Urban Stormwater Retention"
msgstr "Retención de aguas pluviales urbanas"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:63
msgid "Biophysical table"
msgstr "Tabla biofísica"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:65
msgid ""
"Table mapping each LULC code found in the LULC raster to biophysical data about that LULC class. "
"If you provide the percolation coefficient column (PE_[X]) for any soil group, you must provide "
"it for all four soil groups."
msgstr ""
"Tabla que asigna cada código LULC encontrado en el ráster LULC a los datos biofísicos sobre esa "
"clase LULC. Si proporciona la columna del coeficiente de percolación (PE_[X]) para cualquier "
"grupo de suelos, debe proporcionarla para los cuatro grupos de suelos."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:75
msgid ""
"Event mean concentration of the pollutant in stormwater. You may include any number of these "
"columns for different pollutants, or none at all."
msgstr ""
"Concentración media del contaminante del evento en las aguas pluviales. Puede incluir cualquier "
"número de estas columnas para diferentes contaminantes, o ninguna."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:83
msgid "Stormwater runoff coefficient for soil group A"
msgstr "Coeficiente de escorrentía de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo A"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:88
msgid "Stormwater runoff coefficient for soil group B"
msgstr "Coeficiente de escorrentía de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo B"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:93
msgid "Stormwater runoff coefficient for soil group C"
msgstr "Coeficiente de escorrentía de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo C"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:98
msgid "Stormwater runoff coefficient for soil group D"
msgstr "Coeficiente de escorrentía de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo D"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:103
msgid "Stormwater percolation coefficient for soil group A"
msgstr "Coeficiente de percolación de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo A"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:109
msgid "Stormwater percolation coefficient for soil group B"
msgstr "Coeficiente de percolación de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo B"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:115
msgid "Stormwater percolation coefficient for soil group C"
msgstr "Coeficiente de percolación de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo C"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:121
msgid "Stormwater percolation coefficient for soil group D"
msgstr "Coeficiente de percolación de aguas pluviales para el grupo de suelo D"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:142
msgid "Adjust retention ratios"
msgstr "Ajustar las tasas de retención"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:144
msgid ""
"If true, adjust retention ratios. The adjustment algorithm accounts for drainage effects of "
"nearby impervious surfaces which are directly connected to artifical urban drainage channels "
"(typically roads, parking lots, etc.). Connected impervious surfaces are indicated by the "
"is_connected column in the biophysical table and/or the road centerlines vector."
msgstr ""
"Si se activa, ajusta las proporciones de retención. El algoritmo tiene en cuenta los efectos de "
"drenaje de superficies impermeables cercanas conectadas directamente a canales artificiales de "
"drenaje urbano (por lo general, carreteras, estacionamientos, etc.). Las superficies impermeables"
" conectadas se indican en la columna `is_connected` de la tabla biofísica o en la capa vectorial "
"de ejes de carreteras, o en ambas."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:154
msgid "Retention radius"
msgstr "Radio de retención"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:167
msgid "Road centerlines"
msgstr "Líneas centrales de las carreteras"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:168
msgid "Map of road centerlines"
msgstr "Mapa de líneas centrales de carreteras"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:178
msgid ""
"Areas over which to aggregate results (typically watersheds or sewersheds). The aggregated data "
"are: average retention ratio and total retention volume; average percolation ratio and total "
"percolation volume if percolation data was provided; total retention value if replacement cost "
"was provided; and total avoided pollutant load for each pollutant provided."
msgstr ""
"Zonas sobre las que se van a agregar los resultados (normalmente cuencas hidrográficas o de "
"alcantarillado). Los datos agregados son: ratio de retención media y volumen de retención total; "
"ratio de percolación media y volumen de percolación total si se facilitan datos de percolación; "
"valor de retención total si se facilita el costo de reposición; y carga contaminante total "
"evitada para cada contaminante facilitado."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:189
msgid "Replacement cost"
msgstr "Costo de sustitución"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:190
msgid "Replacement cost of stormwater retention devices"
msgstr "Costo de sustitución de los dispositivos de retención de aguas pluviales"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:200
msgid ""
"Map of the stormwater retention ratio, derived from the LULC raster and biophysical table RC_x "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"Mapa del coeficiente de retención de aguas pluviales, derivado del ráster LULC y de las columnas "
"RC_x de la tabla biofísica."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:210
msgid ""
"Map of the adjusted retention ratio, calculated according to equation (124) from the "
"‘retention_ratio, ratio_average, near_road’, and ‘near_impervious_lulc’ intermediate outputs."
msgstr ""
"Mapa del coeficiente de retención ajustado, calculado según la ecuación (124) a partir de los "
"resultados intermedios ‘retention_ratio, ratio_average, near_road’ y ‘near_impervious_lulc’ ."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:221
msgid "Map of retention volume."
msgstr "Mapa de volumen de retención."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:229
msgid ""
"Map of percolation ratio derived by cross-referencing the LULC and soil group rasters with the "
"biophysical table."
msgstr ""
"Mapa del coeficiente de percolación derivado de las referencias cruzadas de los rásters LULC y de"
" grupos de suelos con la tabla biofísica."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:239
msgid "Map of percolation (potential aquifer recharge) volume."
msgstr "Mapa del volumen de percolación (recarga potencial del acuífero)."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:248
msgid "Map of the stormwater runoff ratio. This is the inverse of ‘retention_ratio.tif’"
msgstr "Mapa del coeficiente de escorrentía de aguas pluviales. Es el inverso de 'retention_ratio.tif'."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:257
#: src/natcap/invest/urban_flood_risk_mitigation/urban_flood_risk_mitigation.py:216
msgid "Map of runoff volume."
msgstr "Mapa del volumen de la escorrentía."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:264
msgid "Map of the value of water retained."
msgstr "Mapa del valor del agua retenida."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:273
msgid ""
"Map of aggregate data. This is identical to the aggregate areas input vector, but each polygon is"
" given additional fields with the aggregate data."
msgstr ""
"Mapa de datos agregados. Es idéntico al vector de entrada de áreas agregadas, pero cada polígono "
"recibe campos adicionales con los datos agregados."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:282
msgid "Average retention ratio over this polygon"
msgstr "Tasa media de retención en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:286
msgid "Total retention volume over this polygon"
msgstr "Volumen total de retención en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:291
msgid "Average runoff coefficient over this polygon"
msgstr "Coeficiente medio de escorrentía en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:295
msgid "Total runoff volume over this polygon"
msgstr "Volumen total de escorrentía en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:301
msgid "Average percolation (recharge) ratio over this polygon"
msgstr "Tasa media de percolación (recarga) en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:308
msgid "Total volume of potential aquifer recharge over this polygon"
msgstr "Volumen total de recarga potencial del acuífero para este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:316
msgid "Total avoided (retained) amount of pollutant over this polygon"
msgstr "Cantidad total evitada (retenida) de contaminantes en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:323
msgid "Total amount of pollutant in runoff over this polygon"
msgstr "Cantidad total de contaminantes en la escorrentía de este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:330
msgid "Total value of the retained volume of water over this polygon"
msgstr "Valor total del volumen de agua retenida en este polígono"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:340
msgid "Avoided load of each pollutant"
msgstr "Carga evitada de cada contaminante"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:347
msgid "Actual load of each pollutant"
msgstr "Carga real de cada contaminante"

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:355
msgid "Copy of the soil group raster input, cropped to the intersection of the three raster inputs."
msgstr ""
"Copia de la entrada ráster del grupo de suelos, recortada en la intersección de las tres entradas"
" ráster."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:365
msgid ""
"Copy of the soil group raster input, aligned to the LULC raster and cropped to the intersection "
"of the three raster inputs."
msgstr ""
"Copia de la entrada ráster del grupo de suelos, alineada con la entrada ráster LULC y recortada "
"en la intersección de las tres entradas ráster."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:375
msgid ""
"Copy of the precipitation raster input, aligned to the LULC raster and cropped to the "
"intersection of the three raster inputs."
msgstr ""
"Copia del ráster de precipitaciones, alineada con el ráster LULC y recortada en la intersección "
"de los tres rásters."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:386
msgid "Copy of the road centerlines vector input, reprojected to the LULC raster projection."
msgstr ""
"Copia de la entrada vectorial de las líneas centrales de las carreteras, reproyectada a la "
"proyección ráster LULC."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:396
msgid ""
"A rasterized version of the reprojected centerlines vector, where 1 means the pixel is a road and"
" 0 means it isn’t."
msgstr ""
"Una versión rasterizada del vector de líneas centrales reproyectado, donde 1 significa que el "
"píxel es una carretera y 0 significa que no lo es."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:406
msgid ""
"A binary raster derived from the LULC raster and biophysical table is_connected column, where 1 "
"means the pixel has a directly-connected impervious LULC type, and 0 means it does not."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster binario derivado del ráster LULC y de la columna is_connected de la tabla biofísica, "
"donde 1 significa que el píxel tiene un tipo LULC impermeable directamente conectado, y 0 "
"significa que no lo tiene."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:418
msgid ""
"A raster derived from the rasterized centerlines map, where each pixel’s value is its minimum "
"distance to a road pixel (measured centerpoint-to-centerpoint)."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster derivado del mapa de líneas centrales rasterizadas, donde el valor de cada píxel es su "
"distancia mínima a un píxel de carretera (medida de punto central a punto central)."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:429
msgid ""
"A raster derived from the is_connected_lulc map, where each pixel’s value is its minimum distance"
" to a connected impervious LULC pixel (measured centerpoint-to-centerpoint)."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster derivado del mapa is_connected_lulc, en la que el valor de cada píxel es su distancia "
"mínima a un píxel LULC impermeable conectado (medida de punto central a punto central)."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:440
msgid ""
"A binary raster derived from the road_distance map, where 1 means the pixel is within the "
"retention radius of a road pixel, and 0 means it isn’t."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster binario derivado del mapa road_distance, donde 1 significa que el píxel está dentro del"
" radio de retención de un píxel de carretera, y 0 significa que no lo está."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:451
msgid ""
"A binary raster derived from the connected_lulc_distance map, where 1 means the pixel is within "
"the retention radius of a connected impervious LULC pixel, and 0 means it isn’t."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster binario derivado del mapa connected_lulc_distance, donde 1 significa que el píxel está "
"dentro del radio de retención de un píxel LULC impermeable conectado, y 0 significa que no lo "
"está."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:462
msgid ""
"A binary raster representing the search kernel that is convolved with the retention_ratio raster "
"to calculate the averaged retention ratio within the retention radius of each pixel."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster binario que representa el núcleo de búsqueda que se convoluciona con el ráster "
"retention_ratio para calcular la relación de retención promediada dentro del radio de retención "
"de cada píxel."

#: src/natcap/invest/stormwater/stormwater.py:473
msgid ""
"A raster where each pixel’s value is the average of its neighborhood of pixels in the "
"retention_ratio map, calculated by convolving the search kernel with the retention ratio raster."
msgstr ""
"Un ráster en que el valor de cada píxel es la media de su vecindad de píxeles en el mapa "
"retention_ratio, calculado mediante la convolución del núcleo de búsqueda con el ráster de tasa "
"de retención."

